<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-K FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-K FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.47 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.77 vs   0.35</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.50 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Sales		   10.11 vs   5.78</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.79 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.32 vs   1.04</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.68 vs   0.58</p>
<p> Sales		   19.40 vs  21.89</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Krakow SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
